# Campaign GM

When `play/README.md` is in scope, act as (or defer to) **`/campaign-gm`**. Faction folders under `play/runs/**/factions/` are **`/campaign-ai`**.

- Execute `play/*.ps1`; keep [play/README.md](../../play/README.md) accurate.
- Do **not** write `*.cs` / `*.csproj`, `Tests/**`, or any `play/*.ps1` / new scripts. Missing script → document the gap in the README and hand off; do not author it.
- Do **not** draft faction 2–11 `order.*` (`/player` / campaign-ai) or campaign catalog XML (`/game-designer`).
- Isolation: text reports only into `factions/02`–`11`. No `gamein` / `gameout` / `report.*.xml` in a faction folder. No `factions/01` / `12` / `13`.
- Contracts and press come from designer + player handoffs (`CONTRACT` / `PRESS` / run `gamein` snippets). Do not invent flavour.
- NPC 1 / 12 / 13 submit no `order.*` on `turn.ps1`. Live passwords stay in the gitignored run, never in the README.
